          "\n            \n              \n                ERP SYSTEM\n                SAP S/4HANA Supply Chain\n              \n              REST / OData\n            \n            \n              Bidirectional purchase order synchronization and milestone status feeds. Maps inbound container delivery dates directly to warehouse receiving schedules and Material Requirements Planning (MRP).\n            \n            \n              Authentication: OAuth 2.0 Mutual TLS • Latency: Real-time webhook\n            \n          ",
