          "\n            \n              \n                ERP SYSTEM\n                Microsoft Dynamics 365 Supply Chain\n              \n              Dataverse Web API\n            \n            \n              Synchronizes inbound container milestone dates into production scheduling registers and purchase order receiving journals with automated delay variance notifications.\n            \n            \n              Authentication: Azure Active Directory OAuth • Latency: Near real-time\n            \n          "
